        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/12e990d635f5d496884058c390fb699e.avif?t=1764073588\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/e32d2708e47f1b54d387d5387b2e61cc.poster.avif?t=1764073588\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/e32d2708e47f1b54d387d5387b2e61cc.webm?t=1764073588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/e32d2708e47f1b54d387d5387b2e61cc.mp4?t=1764073588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two legends of the card world - Solitaire and Spider. Master each of them, and show that you are a master of any deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/ba48f05ea0470297db743f475b6e3b57.avif?t=1764073588\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/30727e03dd54d237326a80fabe2d7854.poster.avif?t=1764073588\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/30727e03dd54d237326a80fabe2d7854.webm?t=1764073588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/30727e03dd54d237326a80fabe2d7854.mp4?t=1764073588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game brings you closer to the top of the global rating. Bypass each opponent and gain a foothold among the elite.<br>Keep an eye on your position in the table and prove that your skill has no equal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/1ab813489bf8c0b3330073711d401d83.avif?t=1764073588\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/219705c947aad1dbf8908846f2910557.poster.avif?t=1764073588\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/219705c947aad1dbf8908846f2910557.webm?t=1764073588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/219705c947aad1dbf8908846f2910557.mp4?t=1764073588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pave the way from Newbie to Legend, increasing your rank for rank. Each new rank marks your progress and brings you closer to the title of champion.<br>Keep winning to reach the top and make history.&quot;</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/12e990d635f5d496884058c390fb699e.avif?t=1764073588\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/e32d2708e47f1b54d387d5387b2e61cc.poster.avif?t=1764073588\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/e32d2708e47f1b54d387d5387b2e61cc.webm?t=1764073588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/e32d2708e47f1b54d387d5387b2e61cc.mp4?t=1764073588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two legends of the card world - Solitaire and Spider. Master each of them, and show that you are a master of any deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/ba48f05ea0470297db743f475b6e3b57.avif?t=1764073588\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/30727e03dd54d237326a80fabe2d7854.poster.avif?t=1764073588\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/30727e03dd54d237326a80fabe2d7854.webm?t=1764073588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/30727e03dd54d237326a80fabe2d7854.mp4?t=1764073588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph